      "description": "Certain Encore GX vehicles with the turbocharged 1.2L (RPO LIH) engine left the factory with an incorrect catalytic converter that does not meet all emission system requirements, so the converter may not properly process exhaust gases. GM emissions recall A202317281 (NHTSA 10197318) covered 2020 Encore GX (paired with 2021 Chevrolet Trailblazer), and a separate later recall covered 2023 Encore GX units with the same wrong-converter problem. Affected vehicles can fail emissions testing.",
      "solution": "Covered under GM emissions recall A202317281 (NHTSA 10197318) - dealers inspect the catalytic converter and replace it with the correct part (e.g. P/N 55515139) at no charge if the wrong unit was installed. Verify eligibility by VIN at nhtsa.gov.",
